Cell["\<\
The kernel of the uniform-chain method on the diamond: from the bottom, each \
of the two chains to the top carries half.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"1a90d90a-4815-4e5c-ab28-70ea1e807ff8"],

